## Quick sanity-check against the two reference styles

| Layer (OSM Bright) | `icon-image` | `text-field` | `icon-text-fit` | `symbol-placement` | Result |
|--------------------|--------------|--------------|-----------------|--------------------|--------|
| `highway-shield-us-interstate` | `"{network}_{ref_length}"` | `"{ref}"` | *undefined* (badge per length) | zoom-function (`{ "base":1, "stops":[[7,"point"],[8,"line"]] }`) | **Shield** (passes placeholder + zoom-function) |
| `highway-shield-us-highway` | `"{network}_{ref_length}"` | `"{ref}"` | *undefined* | same function | **Shield** |
| `highway-shield-us-state` | `"{network}_{ref_length}"` | `"{ref}"` | *undefined* | same function | **Shield** |
| `highway-shield-road` | `"road_{ref_length}"` | `"{ref}"` | *undefined* | same function | **Shield** |
| `place-label` (city) | *none* (or `"city"` static) | `"{name}"` | *none* | `"point"` (string) | **Not a shield** (fails placeholder test) |
| `poi-label` (cafe) | `"cafe"` (static) | `"{name}"` | *none* | `"point"` | **Not a shield** (fails placeholder test) |

All shield layers are correctly identified; all non-shield layers are rejected.

